#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:1
msgid "Key Library"
msgstr "Key Library"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:3
msgid ""
"The key library lists all available keys that you can drag and drop into the"
" editor."
msgstr "Key Library には、エディターへドラッグ＆ドロップできる利用可能なキーが一覧表示されます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:5
msgid "![1742263121475](image/getting_started/1742263121475.png)"
msgstr "![1742263121475](image/getting_started/1742263121475.png)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:5
msgid "1742263121475"
msgstr "1742263121475"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:7
msgid "Feature descriptions:"
msgstr "機能の説明:"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:9
msgid "Key search"
msgstr "キー検索"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:10
msgid "Key category filter toggle: Enable or disable a key library here"
msgstr "キーカテゴリのフィルター: Key Library の表示を切り替えます"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:11
msgid "Import a key library or plugin from file or link"
msgstr "ファイルまたはリンクから Key Library 用データやプラグインを取り込む"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:12
msgid ""
"Key library quick navigation: Click to jump to the corresponding key library"
msgstr "クイックナビ: クリックで該当の Key Library へ移動"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:13
msgid ""
"Key library: Click to collapse or expand, supports nested sub-key libraries"
msgstr "Key Library: クリックで折りたたみ／展開。入れ子のサブライブラリに対応"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:14
msgid "Keys: Drag and drop keys to the editor"
msgstr "キー: エディターへドラッグ＆ドロップして配置"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_library.md:16
msgid "Imported `flexpages` and installed plugins will also be displayed here"
msgstr "インポートした `flexpages` やインストール済みのプラグインもここに表示されます"
